{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionKey","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"SessionKey.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/SessionKey.swift#L24"},"symbolKind":"enum","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"externalID":"s:6Events10SessionKeyO","roleHeading":"Enumeration","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionKey"}],"title":"SessionKey"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SourceLocation","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"],"generated":true,"title":"Records","anchor":"Records"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionKey","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination reads it from each record’s context:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let session = record.context[SessionKey.self]  \/\/ a UUID"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The identifier is a version 7 UUID: its first 48 bits are the session’s start, the timestamp","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of its first record, in Unix milliseconds, and the other 74 bits that aren’t the version and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"variant are random, never derived from the device, the user or another identifier. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enricher keeps it in memory only, so a new tracker, as on the next launch, starts a new session","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a new identifier.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A store keeps it beside each record of the session, as part of the record’s own bytes, and it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is deleted when the store deletes the record’s bytes (a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore"},{"type":"text","text":": once its whole segment"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is delivered). So a record recovered after a relaunch carries the session it was tracked in,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a destination sends it under the same identifier as before. It is the only part of a record’s context a store keeps, and a store never keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it apart from a record."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/sessionkey"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" key of the session an event was tracked in: a random identifier that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sessions"},{"type":"text","text":") sets on every record’s context."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/Value"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Aliases","anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/InstrumentationContextKey-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/15Instrumentation0A10ContextKeyP","doc:\/\/Events\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Events\